    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired: Preliminary Plan - Ya 2771 Situation Village - Kopay South & Urumpirai GN Division - Kopay Center, J/261 DS Division - Valikamam, East District - Jaffna Province - Northern Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Valaipitti; Description: Garden contains one permanent building and a masonry wells; Claimants: Iyadurai Dharmarasa, Dharmarasa Ranjani and Dharmarasa Suganthan; Extent: 0.4967 Hectare.",
